1
00:00:00,786 --> 00:00:02,786
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:05,051 --> 00:00:07,821
(Penny:)So, you really
gonna break up with her?

3
00:00:07,821 --> 00:00:11,391
(Raj:)Yeah, I think so.
Do you have any advice?

4
00:00:11,391 --> 00:00:13,891
(Penny:)Well, I have broken up
with my fair share of guys.

5
00:00:13,894 --> 00:00:16,194
(Penny:)I mean, how many times
did I break up with Leonard?

6
00:00:16,196 --> 00:00:19,096
(Leonard:)I stopped
counting at four.

7
00:00:19,099 --> 00:00:21,129
(Penny:)All right, my advice to you
is do it at her place

8
00:00:21,134 --> 00:00:22,964
(Penny:)so you can leave
when you need to,

9
00:00:22,969 --> 00:00:24,299
(Penny:)uh, tell the truth,
make it quick

10
00:00:24,304 --> 00:00:26,904
(Penny:)and be prepared for tears.

11
00:00:26,907 --> 00:00:28,577
(Raj:)Oh, I'm gonna do a pre-cry
before I go in there.

12
00:00:28,575 --> 00:00:31,145
(Raj:)Really dry myself out.

13
00:00:32,045 --> 00:00:33,675
(Leonard:)She meant Emily.

14
00:00:33,680 --> 00:00:37,050
No, I-I really didn't.

15
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:39,850
(Emily:)You're seriously
breaking up with me?

16
00:00:39,853 --> 00:00:41,123
(Leonard:)Yeah.

17
00:00:41,121 --> 00:00:42,591
(Emily:)And you thought
right before Valentine's Day

18
00:00:42,589 --> 00:00:44,389
(Emily:)was a good time to do it?

19
00:00:45,725 --> 00:00:48,765
(Raj:)You're right...
let's talk again in a few days.

20
00:00:48,762 --> 00:00:52,532
(Raj(on phone):)Hey, Claire.
Hi. It's-it's Rajesh.

21
00:00:52,532 --> 00:00:55,162
I was-I was wondering if you're
free for Valentine's Day?

22
00:00:55,168 --> 00:00:57,668
(Claire:)Sorry, I just got back
with my boyfriend.

23
00:00:57,671 --> 00:00:59,841
(Raj:)But I just broke up
with my girlfriend.

24
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,810
(Claire:)Right before Valentine's Day?

